# 必考词 Unit 10 短语

## 常考短语

- **distinguish A from B**: 区分A和B — Can you distinguish fact from fiction? 你能区分事实和虚构吗？
- **distinguish oneself**: 使自己杰出 — She distinguished herself as a talented writer. 她作为才华横溢的作家脱颖而出。
- **distribute…to/among**: 分配给 — The food was distributed to the refugees. 食物被分发给了难民。
- **a diverse range of**: 多种多样的 — The store offers a diverse range of products. 商店提供多种多样的产品。
- **domestic market**: 国内市场 — The company focuses on the domestic market. 公司专注于国内市场。
- **be dominant in**: 在…中占主导地位 — The company is dominant in the industry. 该公司在行业中占主导地位。
- **be doomed to**: 注定 — The plan was doomed to fail. 这个计划注定要失败。
- **a dose of**: 一剂 — A dose of humor can lighten the mood. 一点幽默可以活跃气氛。
- **a draft of**: 草稿 — He showed me the first draft of his novel. 他给我看了小说的初稿。
- **drag on**: 拖延 — The meeting dragged on for hours. 会议拖了好几个小时。
- **dramatic change**: 巨大变化 — The city has undergone dramatic changes. 这座城市经历了巨大变化。
- **due to**: 由于 — The delay was due to bad weather. 延误是由于恶劣天气。
- **in due course**: 在适当的时候 — You will hear from us in due course. 你会在适当的时候收到我们的消息。
- **dump…on**: 把…倾倒在 — Don't dump your problems on me. 不要把你的问题推给我。
- **be eager to do**: 渴望做 — She was eager to start her new job. 她渴望开始新工作。
- **have an effect on**: 对…有影响 — The policy had a positive effect on the economy. 这项政策对经济产生了积极影响。
- **in effect**: 实际上；生效 — The new rule is now in effect. 新规定现已生效。
- **put into effect**: 实施 — The plan was put into effect immediately. 计划立即实施了。
- **elaborate on**: 详细阐述 — Could you elaborate on this point? 你能详细阐述一下这一点吗？
- **place emphasis on**: 强调 — The school places emphasis on practical skills. 学校强调实用技能。
